      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The state of an external connection which is in the process of being pulled from a remote device to the local device.</para>
          <para>A connection can only be in this state if the PROPERTY_IS_EXTERNAL_CALL property and CAPABILITY_CAN_PULL_CALL capability bits are set on the connection.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telecom/Connection#STATE_PULLING_CALL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telecom.Connection.STATE_PULLING_CALL</code>.</a></format></para>
